# Factory-reset clear faults: fail retries, crash commits then resumes
name: clear-faults
version: 1
description: fail_clear_next leaves the log intact and retries; crash_clear_next clears then resumes on reboot.

boot
rtc SYNCED 1700000000000
read CHIP-001
read CHIP-002
assert observations 2
fail_clear_next
factory_reset
assert not_ready
assert observations 2
factory_reset
assert ready
assert observations 0
assert next_sequence 1
assert node_id changed
read CHIP-A
assert observations 1
crash_clear_next
factory_reset
reboot
assert observations 0
assert next_sequence 1
assert node_id changed
